msgid "Checking for updates…"
msgstr "Memeriksa update…"

msgid "Up to date"
msgstr "Sudah terbaru"

msgid "Version {} available — press OK to install"
msgstr "Versi {} tersedia — tekan OK untuk menginstal"

msgid "Allow RustTV to install apps, then press OK to install {}"
msgstr "Izinkan RustTV menginstal aplikasi, lalu tekan OK untuk menginstal {}"

msgid "Downloading {}%"
msgstr "Mendownload {}%"

msgid "Installing…"
msgstr "Menginstal…"

msgid "Update installed"
msgstr "Update terinstal"

msgid "Update failed: {}"
msgstr "Update gagal: {}"

msgid "Press OK to check for updates"
msgstr "Tekan OK untuk memeriksa update"

msgid "Hide from Home"
msgstr "Sembunyikan dari layar utama"

msgid "Move"
msgstr "Pindahkan"

msgid "Couldn't open {}"
msgstr "Tidak dapat membuka {}"

msgid "Couldn't load apps: {}"
msgstr "Tidak dapat memuat aplikasi: {}"

msgid "Couldn't load the licence notices: {}"
msgstr "Tidak dapat memuat pemberitahuan lisensi: {}"

msgid "Hidden apps"
msgstr "Aplikasi tersembunyi"

msgid "About"
msgstr "Tentang"

msgid "OK puts the app back on Home. Back returns."
msgstr "OK mengembalikan aplikasi ke layar utama. Tekan Kembali untuk kembali."

msgid "Version {} · MIT OR Apache-2.0"
msgstr "Versi {} · MIT OR Apache-2.0"

msgid "Built with Slint under the Slint Royalty-free License 2.0. Also includes Skia (BSD-3-Clause) and Rust libraries under MIT or Apache-2.0."
msgstr "Dibuat dengan Slint di bawah Slint Royalty-free License 2.0. Juga menyertakan Skia (BSD-3-Clause) dan library Rust di bawah MIT atau Apache-2.0."

msgid "Source: github.com/damienmiheev/rusttv"
msgstr "Kode sumber: github.com/damienmiheev/rusttv"

msgid "Up and Down scroll the notices. Back returns."
msgstr "Atas dan Bawah untuk menggulir. Tekan Kembali untuk kembali."

msgid "Third-party notices"
msgstr "Pemberitahuan pihak ketiga"

msgid "Updates"
msgstr "Update"

msgid "History"
msgstr "Riwayat"

msgid "Waiting for your computer"
msgstr "Menunggu komputer Anda"

msgid "Animations"
msgstr "Animasi"

msgid "Faster (0.5×)"
msgstr "Lebih cepat (0,5×)"

msgid "Off"
msgstr "Nonaktif"

msgid "Normal"
msgstr "Normal"

msgid "On"
msgstr "Aktif"

msgid "Transition animations"
msgstr "Animasi transisi"

msgid "Window animations"
msgstr "Animasi jendela"

msgid "App animations"
msgstr "Animasi aplikasi"

msgid "off"
msgstr "nonaktif"

msgid "not seen"
msgstr "tidak ditemukan"

msgid "on"
msgstr "aktif"

msgid "default"
msgstr "default"

msgid "Your computer"
msgstr "Komputer Anda"

msgid "Changed outside RustTV"
msgstr "Diubah di luar RustTV"

msgid "Restored from your computer"
msgstr "Dipulihkan dari komputer Anda"

msgid "This TV"
msgstr "TV ini"

msgid "time unknown"
msgstr "waktu tidak diketahui"

msgid "Apps reordered"
msgstr "Urutan aplikasi diubah"

msgid "Hid {}"
msgstr "{} disembunyikan"

msgid "Showed {}"
msgstr "{} ditampilkan"

msgid "Check for updates: {}"
msgstr "Periksa update: {}"

msgid "{}: {} → {}"
msgstr "{}: {} → {}"

msgid "Firmware updated"
msgstr "Firmware diperbarui"

msgid "Home takeover: {}"
msgstr "Ambil alih layar utama: {}"

msgid "No change"
msgstr "Tidak ada perubahan"

msgid "Your computer applies these: run rusttv history apply-pending within 2 hours"
msgstr "Diterapkan komputer Anda: jalankan rusttv history apply-pending dalam 2 jam"

msgid "This TV changes now"
msgstr "TV ini berubah sekarang"

msgid "To change this on the TV itself, run rusttv history allow-tv-settings on your computer once. Until then your computer applies it."
msgstr "Untuk mengubahnya langsung di TV, jalankan rusttv history allow-tv-settings sekali di komputer Anda. Sampai saat itu, komputer Anda yang menerapkannya."

msgid "Some apps may look odd without animations."
msgstr "Beberapa aplikasi mungkin tampak aneh tanpa animasi."

msgid "No changes yet. Changes made here or from your computer appear here."
msgstr "Belum ada perubahan. Perubahan dari TV ini atau dari komputer Anda akan muncul di sini."

msgid "{} (+{} more)"
msgstr "{} (+{} lainnya)"

msgid "Restore this state"
msgstr "Pulihkan keadaan ini"

msgid "Check for updates automatically"
msgstr "Periksa update secara otomatis"

msgid "{} min"
msgstr "{} mnt"

msgid "{} h {} min"
msgstr "{} jam {} mnt"

msgid "On your computer, run rusttv history apply-pending within {}."
msgstr "Di komputer Anda, jalankan rusttv history apply-pending dalam {}."

msgid "Applied."
msgstr "Diterapkan."

msgid "Saved for your computer. {}"
msgstr "Disimpan untuk komputer Anda. {}"

msgid "Nothing changed: {}"
msgstr "Tidak ada yang diubah: {}"

msgid "Nothing changed: wrong code."
msgstr "Tidak ada yang diubah: kode salah."

msgid "Too many wrong codes. Approvals are locked for {}."
msgstr "Terlalu banyak kode salah. Persetujuan dikunci selama {}."

msgid "Approvals are off in test builds."
msgstr "Persetujuan nonaktif di build uji."

msgid "Busy — try again in a moment."
msgstr "Sibuk — coba lagi sebentar lagi."

msgid "Couldn't undo everything: {}. Fix it with rusttv history restore on your computer, or in Android Settings."
msgstr "Tidak semua bisa dibatalkan: {}. Perbaiki dengan rusttv history restore di komputer Anda, atau di Setelan Android."

msgid "This is the state now: nothing to restore."
msgstr "Ini sudah keadaan saat ini: tidak ada yang perlu dipulihkan."

msgid "Your computer has a newer RustTV. Update RustTV on this TV."
msgstr "Komputer Anda memiliki RustTV yang lebih baru. Perbarui RustTV di TV ini."

msgid "Reading history…"
msgstr "Membaca riwayat…"

msgid "History couldn't be read: {}. Your computer's copy can put it back."
msgstr "Riwayat tidak dapat dibaca: {}. Salinan di komputer Anda bisa memulihkannya."

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Setelan"

msgid "Up and Down choose, OK opens. Back returns."
msgstr "Atas dan Bawah untuk memilih, OK untuk membuka. Tekan Kembali untuk kembali."

msgid "Review changes"
msgstr "Tinjau perubahan"

msgid "Up and Down read the changes. Choose Approve to go on. Back cancels."
msgstr "Atas dan Bawah untuk membaca perubahan. Pilih Setujui untuk lanjut. Kembali untuk membatalkan."

msgid "Nothing changes until you hold OK. Back cancels."
msgstr "Tidak ada yang berubah sampai Anda menahan OK. Kembali untuk membatalkan."

msgid "Approve"
msgstr "Setujui"

msgid "Press these arrows on the remote:"
msgstr "Tekan panah ini di remote:"

msgid "Now hold OK to apply."
msgstr "Sekarang tahan OK untuk menerapkan."

msgid "Fastest (0.25×)"
msgstr "Tercepat (0,25×)"

msgid "Fast (0.75×)"
msgstr "Cepat (0,75×)"

msgid "Slower (1.5×)"
msgstr "Lebih lambat (1,5×)"

msgid "Slowest (2×)"
msgstr "Paling lambat (2×)"

msgid "History started"
msgstr "Riwayat dimulai"

msgid "Added {}"
msgstr "{} ditambahkan"

msgid "Removed {}"
msgstr "{} dihapus"

msgid "Games"
msgstr "Game"

msgid "Music"
msgstr "Musik"

msgid "Video"
msgstr "Video"

msgid "Photos"
msgstr "Foto"

msgid "Social"
msgstr "Sosial"

msgid "News"
msgstr "Berita"

msgid "Maps"
msgstr "Peta"

msgid "Productivity"
msgstr "Produktivitas"

msgid "Accessibility"
msgstr "Aksesibilitas"

msgid "Folder"
msgstr "Folder"

msgid "Type a name, then press ✓. Back keeps the old one."
msgstr "Ketik nama, lalu tekan ✓. Kembali mempertahankan yang lama."

msgid "Move past the edge to take the app out. OK drops it."
msgstr "Lewati tepi untuk mengeluarkan aplikasi. OK menaruhnya."

msgid "Back closes the folder. Up reaches its name."
msgstr "Kembali menutup folder. Atas menuju namanya."

msgid "Made the folder {}"
msgstr "Folder {} dibuat"

msgid "Removed the folder {}"
msgstr "Folder {} dihapus"

msgid "Renamed the folder {} to {}"
msgstr "Folder {} diganti nama menjadi {}"

msgid "Put {} in {}"
msgstr "{} dimasukkan ke {}"

msgid "Took {} out of {}"
msgstr "{} dikeluarkan dari {}"

# RustTV Remote (REMOTE.md)
msgid "RustTV Remote"
msgstr "RustTV Remote"

msgid "Use a phone as a remote, keyboard and touchpad. It can press keys and type, but never change settings or approve anything."
msgstr "Gunakan ponsel sebagai remote, keyboard, dan touchpad. Ponsel bisa menekan tombol dan mengetik, tetapi tidak pernah mengubah setelan atau menyetujui apa pun."

msgid "Pair a phone"
msgstr "Pasangkan ponsel"

msgid "Shows a code to scan with the phone's camera"
msgstr "Menampilkan kode untuk kamera ponsel"

msgid "Press OK again to remove it"
msgstr "Tekan OK lagi untuk menghapus"

msgid "OK removes it"
msgstr "OK menghapusnya"

msgid "RustTV Remote can't start: another app uses its network port (8484)."
msgstr "RustTV Remote tidak bisa dimulai: aplikasi lain memakai port jaringannya (8484)."

msgid "This TV has no network address. Connect it to your network and try again."
msgstr "TV ini tidak punya alamat jaringan. Hubungkan ke jaringan Anda lalu coba lagi."

msgid "Pairing stopped after three wrong tries. Back returns; open Pair a phone again for a new code."
msgstr "Pemasangan dihentikan setelah tiga percobaan salah. Tekan Kembali untuk kembali; buka Pasangkan ponsel lagi untuk kode baru."

msgid "Couldn't make the code."
msgstr "Kode tidak bisa dibuat."

msgid "Removed {}. It can't control this TV any more."
msgstr "{} dihapus. Ponsel itu tidak bisa lagi mengontrol TV ini."

msgid "OK allows this phone. Back refuses."
msgstr "OK mengizinkan ponsel ini. Kembali menolaknya."

msgid "Back returns."
msgstr "Tekan Kembali untuk kembali."

msgid "Scan this code with your phone's camera and open the link.\n\nThe phone must be on the same network as this TV. The code works once, for two minutes."
msgstr "Pindai kode ini dengan kamera ponsel dan buka tautannya.\n\nPonsel harus berada di jaringan yang sama dengan TV ini. Kode berlaku sekali, selama dua menit."

msgid "Allow “{}”?"
msgstr "Izinkan “{}”?"

msgid "Check that the phone shows the same code:"
msgstr "Pastikan ponsel menampilkan kode yang sama:"

msgid "It will be able to press keys and type on this TV. It can never change settings or approve anything."
msgstr "Ponsel ini akan bisa menekan tombol dan mengetik di TV ini. Ponsel tidak pernah bisa mengubah setelan atau menyetujui apa pun."

msgid "“{}” is paired."
msgstr "“{}” sudah terpasang."

msgid "Trust this TV"
msgstr "Percayai TV ini"

msgid "“{}” is installing this TV's certificate, “{}”."
msgstr "“{}” sedang memasang sertifikat TV ini, “{}”."

msgid "Before installing, check on the phone that its SHA-256 fingerprint starts with:"
msgstr "Sebelum memasang, periksa di ponsel bahwa sidik jari SHA-256-nya diawali dengan:"

msgid "If it doesn't match, don't install it: someone on your network may be interfering."
msgstr "Jika tidak cocok, jangan pasang: seseorang di jaringan Anda mungkin mengganggu."

msgid "Pointer in other apps"
msgstr "Penunjuk di aplikasi lain"

msgid "Off · OK opens Accessibility: turn on RustTV Pointer there"
msgstr "Nonaktif · OK membuka Aksesibilitas: aktifkan RustTV Pointer di sana"

msgid "On · the phone's touchpad moves a pointer in other apps · OK opens Accessibility"
msgstr "Aktif · touchpad ponsel menggerakkan penunjuk di aplikasi lain · OK membuka Aksesibilitas"

msgid "Not on this device"
msgstr "Tidak tersedia di perangkat ini"

msgid "Paired the phone {}"
msgstr "Ponsel {} dipasangkan"

msgid "Removed the phone {}"
msgstr "Ponsel {} dihapus"
